	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Una cum tota familia bene et in pace dego.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hisce diebus <placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> fui.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Illic tuas simul <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et meas litteras clarissimo senatui praesentavi, quibus praelectis grati fuerunt de rebus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>meis honeste collocatis tribus coronatis; tantum scilicet me donarunt, super <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>qua tenacitate non satis mirari potuit dominus et charissimus meus <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vir senatorius, urbis questor <persName ref="p8012">Sulpicius Hallerus</persName> te plurimum salutari iussit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Is, dum causa mea ventilaretur, in senatu non fuit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego domino deo meo gratias ago, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>qui non permittit me ob res temporarias nimium turbari; didici per eundem et dives <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>esse et pauper; utraque sors me pariter amplectitur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In te uno hactenus didici, quam bene <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>michi velit dominus; huic soli laus et honor in sęculo.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Scripsi domino <persName ref="p5717">Ieorgio Subekero</persName><note type="misc">Lub...? G's Schwager <persName ref="p5717">Jörg Lübegger</persName>?</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quantum salarii michi annuatim cedat; is te, ubi postulaveris, hac de re certiorem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>reddere potest.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Interim vale in domino, męcenas optime; coniugem tuam in domino et michi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>charam una cum tota tua familia ex me salutabis quam officiosissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l285">Lentzburgi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>anno 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8440">Ge<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>rvasius</persName> tuus, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>in domino ut semper tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nobilis ab <persName ref="p3559">Hallwyl</persName> visis tuis de me litteris <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pollicendo michi omnem operam humanissim<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>e <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>me tractavit, quantum ego iudico, vir val<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>de <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>bonus et pius est.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Salutat multis <persName ref="p8369">Hermannus</persName> scriba, vir veritatis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et innocentię amans.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximiae pietatis et eruditionis <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro m. <persName ref="p495">Heynricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesiae antistiti, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratri et veteri amico charissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>meo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
